<title>USA: Reno Air Feb load factor falls to 64 pct.</title>
<headline>Reno Air Feb load factor falls to 64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reno Air Inc Friday said traffic grew by 11.9 percent in February to 403,671 passengers, from 360,613 passengers a year ago.</p>
<p>The carrier's February load factor fell to 64.0 percent from 68.2 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>			    RENO AIR FEBRUARY TRAFFIC RESULTS</p>
<p>				    1997	1996    PERCENT CHANGE</p>
<p>RPMs (000)			224,590   212,357	 5.8%</p>
<p>    ASMs (000)		  350,716   311,235	12.7%</p>
<p>    Load Factor (%)		64.0	68.2    -4.2 points</p>
<p>    Passengers		   403,671   360,613	11.9%</p>
<p>					YEAR-TO-DATE</p>
<p>				 Two Months Ended February 28</p>
<p>				   1997	1996    PERCENT CHANGE</p>
<p>    RPMs (000)		   440,445   394,106	11.8%</p>
<p>    ASMs (000)		   727,153   613,575	18.5%</p>
<p>    Load Factor (%)	     60.6	64.2    -3.6 points</p>
<p>    Passengers		   781,811   681,084	14.8%</p>
</text>
